<title>SPAIN: Enher Group 9-mth net profit 7.8 bln ptas.</title>
<headline>Enher Group 9-mth net profit 7.8 bln ptas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for first nine months in billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Pretax profit			  12.759    up 29.4 percent</p>
<p> Net group taxed			 7.852    up 16.8 percent</p>
<p> Operating costs		     132.337    down 3.9 percent</p>
<p> Group financial costs		 5.074    vs   5.905</p>
<p>NOTE- Results for Enher Group include Enher, Hidroelectrica de Catalunya and Termicas del Besos. Customer demand rose 1.3 percent in the first nine months and was worth 144.329 billion. Capital investment went mostly into improving Enher Group's distribution network. Enher Group's debt was 106.046 billion pesetas in the first nine months. Its workforce will fall by 168 people to 2,668 this year as a result of early retirements.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
